([CASE STUDY 1: Applying SCAMPER to Redesign a Campus Library App]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: University library usage plummeted because students found the physical) Tj
T*
(book reservation and study room booking system cumbersome.) Tj
T*
(SCAMPER Ideation Sprint:) Tj
T*
(- Substitute: Substitute manual plastic library ID scanning with biometric facial) Tj
T*
(recognition or smartphone NFC tap.) Tj
T*
(- Combine: Combine the library catalog with course syllabi and student LMS deadlines so) Tj
T*
(recommended reserve books appear automatically inside weekly course modules.) Tj
T*
(- Adapt: Adapt the Uber real-time mapping interface to display live interactive heatmaps) Tj
T*
(of vacant library study cubicles and power outlets.) Tj
T*
(- Modify/Magnify: Magnify group collaboration by creating virtual study rooms with) Tj
T*
(shared digital whiteboards.) Tj
T*
(- Put to another use: Use library silent zones at night as low-cost proctored online) Tj
T*
(certification testing centers.) Tj
T*
(- Eliminate: Eliminate paper late fee slips; replace with automated SMS notifications) Tj
T*
(and community book-sharing credits.) Tj
T*
(- Reverse: Instead of students searching for books, books search for students: students) Tj
T*
(post research topics and librarians push curated digital collections.) Tj
T*
(Selected Concept: An integrated 'Smart Library Assistant' inside the campus mobile) Tj
T*
(portal boosting student study room reservations by 320%.) Tj
