(Affinity Clustering Categories:) Tj
T*
(Cluster A \(Portion Control & Serving Logistics\): Smaller serving ladles, self-service) Tj
T*
(tasting spoons, tray-less dining hall layouts.) Tj
T*
(Cluster B \(Real-time Food Demand Forecasting\): Machine learning algorithms predicting) Tj
T*
(daily meal attendance based on exam schedules and weather.) Tj
T*
(Cluster C \(Social Incentives & Gamification\): Digital leaderboards tracking food waste) Tj
T*
(by hostel floor, awarding dining hall points for zero-waste plates.) Tj
T*
(Cluster D \(Surplus Repurposing & Composting\): Automated biogas digesters converting) Tj
T*
(kitchen scraps into cooking fuel for hostel stoves.) Tj
T*
